  (text "Pico 2 W pin map (GP -> net)\nGP0  SPARE\nGP1  MOTOR_PG\nGP2  ON4\nGP3  IMU_INT_GYR\nGP4  SPI0_MISO\nGP5  IMU_CS_ACC\nGP6  SPI0_SCK\nGP7  SPI0_MOSI\nGP8  IMU_INT_ACC\nGP9  SPARE\nGP10 SPI1_SCK\nGP11 SPI1_MOSI\nGP12 SPI1_MISO\nGP13 ON1\nGP14 ON2\nGP15 ON3\nGP16 DSHOT4_MCU\nGP17 DSHOT3_MCU\nGP18 DSHOT2_MCU\nGP19 DSHOT1_MCU\nGP20 I2C_SDA\nGP21 I2C_SCL\nGP22 BOOST_EN\nGP26 FLOW_CS\nGP27 CHG_PG\nGP28 IMU_CS_GYR" (at 500 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4fcde078-5e12-523b-891f-11b6ed666b70)
  )
  (text "Power flags: GND and VSYS enter on J1 (from the frame); 3V3_SENS is fed through L1" (at 500.38 312.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 253e16e2-4540-577a-a094-99c45655ade1)
  )
  (text "MOTOR_PG: the frame ties the four TPS22997 PG outputs together (wired-AND); 47k pull-up R7 here.\n3V3_SENS: BMI088 + BMP390 supply through L1 / C3 against motor noise (Crazyflie Bolt 1.1).\nVBUS (Pico pin 40) is unused: the Pico runs from VSYS; USB D+/D- go to the frame (Pi Zero host).\nDNP: J9 (SWD).  Design doc: docs/Toothpick_Drone_Hardware_Design_1S_Pico2W.pdf" (at 20 395 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f88be8ae-df46-5ff4-8a7d-5617b8069178)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
